      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "These thoughts are signs of deep distress and the intense guilt that often accompanies serious health changes. Please challenge the idea that your presence defines your worth or that your remaining is inherently selfish. True love is often shown through partnership through hard times, not just in comfortable moments. Reaching out to a counselor or support group focused on chronic illness can provide vital tools to manage this overwhelming feeling of guilt.",
      "source": "target",
